<title>USA: TENNIS-WEDNESDAY'S RESULTS FROM AT&amp;T CHALLENGE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WEDNESDAY'S RESULTS FROM AT&amp;T CHALLENGE.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $328,000</p>
<p>AT&amp;T Challenge men's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat 2-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) 4-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2) 6-2</p>
<p>8-Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat Javier Frana (Argentina) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 6-2</p>
<p>Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat 6-Alex O'Brien (U.S.) 7-6</p>
<p>(8-6) 6-4</p>
<p>Gilbert Schaller (Austria) beat Steve Campbell (U.S.) 6-3 4-6</p>
<p>6-1</p>
</text>
